sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User (pharmacy manager)
    participant A as A: Account
    participant PS as PS: PharmacyStaff
    participant PH as PH: Pharmacy
    participant L as L: Listing
    participant SL as SL: SyncLog
    participant FI as FI: FeedImport
    participant SJ as SJ: ScheduledJob
    participant N as N: Notification

    Note over U,N: Part A - Dashboard (last-sync time and preview of the public listing)

    U->>A: login()
    A-->>U: authenticated session
    U->>PS: viewLastSync()
    PS->>A: hasPermission()
    A-->>PS: permission result
    PS->>A: canAccessPharmacy()
    A-->>PS: own pharmacy only
    break access denied
        PS-->>U: Error (no access to this pharmacy)
    end

    PS->>PH: isSyncStale()
    PH->>SL: getLatestFor()
    SL-->>PH: latest sync (syncedAt, success)
    PH->>SL: isOlderThan(24 hours)
    SL-->>PH: true or false
    PH-->>PS: last-sync time and stale flag

    PS->>PH: isVisibleInSearch()
    PH->>PH: isVerified()
    PH-->>PS: live status and verified badge

    PS->>PH: getListings()
    loop each Listing
        PH->>L: isInStock()
        L-->>PH: stock status, price, lastUpdated
    end
    PH-->>PS: public listing preview
    PS-->>U: Dashboard (last-sync time, stale alert, public listing preview)

    Note over U,N: Part B - Stale-sync alert (background, no user action)

    SJ->>SJ: isDue()
    SJ->>SJ: execute()
    SJ->>SJ: checkStaleSync()
    SJ->>FI: «triggers»
    FI->>PH: isSyncStale()
    PH->>SL: getLatestFor()
    SL-->>PH: latest sync (syncedAt, success)
    PH->>SL: isOlderThan(24 hours)
    SL-->>PH: true or false
    PH-->>FI: stale flag
    FI-->>SJ: stale flag

    alt sync older than 24 hours
        SJ->>N: «triggers»
        N->>N: compose()
        N->>N: send()
        alt email sent
            N-->>A: stale-sync alert addressed to the pharmacy account
            A-->>U: Email: data has not synced within the expected window
        else email failed
            N->>N: markFailed()
            SJ->>SJ: retryFailedEmails()
            SJ->>N: retry()
            N-->>A: stale-sync alert addressed to the pharmacy account
            A-->>U: Email: data has not synced within the expected window
        end
    else sync is fresh
        Note over SJ,FI: No action needed
    end